<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <title>Refund Approved - AirBnB</title>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
</head>

<body
    style="margin: 0; padding: 0; min-width: 100%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; background-color: #FAFAFA; color: #222222;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <div style="background-color: #28A745; padding: 24px; color: #ffffff;">
            <h1
                style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: center;">
                Refund Approved!</h1>
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 24px; background-color: #ffffff;">
            <p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;">Hello {{guestName}},</p>
            <p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;">Great news! Your refund request has been approved by our admin team. The refund of <strong>{{amount}} {{currency}}</strong> is now being processed.</p>
            
            <div style="background-color: #d4edda; padding: 16px; margin: 24px 0; border-left: 4px solid #28A745; color: #155724;">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px;">Refund Status:</h3>
                <p style="margin: 8px 0;"><strong>Status:</strong> Approved & Processing</p>
                <p style="margin: 8px 0;"><strong>Refund Amount:</strong> {{amount}} {{currency}}</p>
                <p style="margin: 8px 0;"><strong>Original Payment Method:</strong> Your registered payment method</p>
            </div>

            <p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;"><strong>Timeline:</strong></p>
            <ul style="margin: 12px 0 24px 24px; padding: 0;">
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Refund initiated immediately</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Processing time: 5-10 business days</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">You will see the refund in your original payment method</li>
            </ul>

            <p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;">Your booking for {{listingTitle}} has been cancelled. If you have any questions about the refund process, please don't hesitate to reach out to our support team.</p>

            <p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;">Thank you for using our service!</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background-color: #f6f6f6; padding: 24px;">
            <p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;">
                For further assistance, please contact our support team.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>